
---

## 🧹 `.gitignore`

Below is a universal `.gitignore` suited for Node.js full-stack projects (`backend` + `frontend`):

```gitignore
# Node modules
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Logs
logs
*.log
*.out
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
coverage/
tmp/
temp/
.cache/

# IDE / Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Dependencies lock files (optional)
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

# Docker
docker-compose.override.yml
.docker/

# Misc
*.zip
*.tar
*.tgz
*.bak
